          <a href="#types" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. The Types Compared</a>
          <a href="#cost" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. What It Costs</a>
